  rdfs:domain :Faculty ;
  rdfs:range :Lecturer ;
.

###  http://www.semanticweb.org/midos/ontologies/2022/11/untitled-ontology-14#offered_by
:offered_by
  a rdf:Property ;
  a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  owl:inverseOf :offers ;
  rdfs:domain :Course ;
  rdfs:range :Faculty ;
.

###  http://www.semanticweb.org/midos/ontologies/2022/11/untitled-ontology-14#offers
